  "body": "Positioned in a sought-after neighbourhood of Browns Bay, these brand-new, two-storey standalone homes offer a rare combination of thoughtful design, quality construction and generous living spaces on flat land.\r\n\r\nEach home features five spacious bedrooms, offering exceptional flexibility for growing families, multi-generational living or those seeking dedicated work-from-home space. The open-plan living and dining area is complemented by a contemporary kitchen featuring strip LED lighting and quality Bosch appliances. Abundant natural light and seamless indoor-outdoor flow create a welcoming environment to relax and unwind after a busy day.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights:\r\n\r\n* 10-year Stamford Warranty for added peace of mind\r\n* One bedroom and bathroom on the ground floor, ideal for guests, extended family or multi-generational living\r\n* Luxurious ensuite accompanying the master bedroom upstairs\r\n* Additional parking available for selected corner homes\r\n* Brand-new standalone homes with quality finishes throughout\r\n* A short stroll to Sherwood School and Northcross Intermediate\r\n\r\nThe location offers an excellent selection of parks and recreational spaces, with Sherwood Reserve and Freyberg Park nearby for family outings, sports and weekend activities. Browns Bay Beach and its waterfront reserve are just minutes away, providing the perfect setting for morning walks, swimming, picnics and enjoying the relaxed coastal lifestyle.\r\n\r\nFor everyday convenience, Browns Bay village is close at hand, offering a fantastic selection of cafés, restaurants, supermarkets, shops and essential services. Albany Mall is only a few minutes' drive away, while Takapuna is approximately 15 minutes away and Auckland CBD around 20 minutes by car.\r\n\r\nCombining modern family living, quality construction and an enviable North Shore location, these exceptional new homes are an opportunity not to be missed.\r\n\r\nEnquire today to arrange a private viewing and experience these homes for yourself.",
